From d2712f5192a9157bdf9237cac5661f523bf17d27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sync: add Tachyon Avalanche fast-path, SnapSync, and reverse
 peel

Add Tachyon P2P fast-path extensions including Avalanche outpoint/block conflict
tracking, `SnapSync` UTXO snapshot synchronization (`getutxosnap`, `utxosnap`),
reverse mempool peel ordering, and multi-threaded `ConnectBlock` coin pre-caching.
